description:
Offices for rent in Bahrain Financial Harbour

Prime Offices for Rent in Brand New Building

Become one of the very first Tenants at the newly development SAYACORP Tower, Bahrain Financial Harbour. The building offers stunning views of Bahrain Bay & Manama, as well as being home to the 5 Star Conrad Bahrain.

By being a Tenant at SAYACORP Tower you will benefit from;

• A prestigious address and landmark location;

• Grade A specifications;

• Five star hotel operator, offering special discounts for SAYACORP Tower office tenants;

• SAYACORP Tower has just received its Gold LEED certification, meaning its sustainable design and operation meet exceptional standards. LEED Building offers a foundation for green buildings that are cost-effective, efficient, and beneficial for health;

• Floor plates ranging from 975sqm - 1404sqm;

• Generous car parking provisions at 1:75sq/m, of leasable area

